a magical box this magical box is amazing. no matter how many are created, they all seem to connect to the same dimension. i can store items in one location, and pull them out somewhere else!

i can use dyes on the top of the box to assign its location, and any box with the same colors will share the same space. using a diamond on the box locks it to me, and me alone.

shift-right-clicking will remove the diamond and the chest will rejoin the public network. {"0": {"autoconsume": 0, "consume": 0, "groupdetect": 0, "ignorenbt": 0, "index": 0, "partialmatch": 1, "requireonlyoneitem": 0, "requireditems": {"0": {"count": 1, "damage": 0, "oredict": "", "id": "enderstorage:enderchest", "resolved": {"id": "i:enderstorage:enderchest:0", "name": "advanced ender chest", "mod": "enderstorage", "registry": "enderchest", "icon": 5442, "nbt": null, "kind": "item", "unit": "items", "damage": 0, "shard": "fd7b541e2c2787b5", "recipes": 1}, "label": "advanced ender chest"}}, "taskid": "bq_standard:retrieval"}} {"0": {"ignoredisabled": 0, "index": 0, "rewardid": "bq_standard:item", "rewards": {"0": {"count": 4, "damage": 0, "oredict": "", "id": "minecraft:nether_star", "resolved": {"id": "i:minecraft:nether_star:0", "name": "nether star", "mod": "minecraft", "registry": "nether_star", "icon": 48404, "nbt": null, "kind": "item", "unit": "items", "damage": 0, "shard": "9e513b21b23b280e", "recipes": 141}, "label": "nether star"}, "1": {"count": 1, "damage": 5, "oredict": "", "id": "minecraft:dye", "resolved": {"id": "i:minecraft:dye:5", "name": "purple dye", "mod": "minecraft", "registry": "dye", "icon": 48251, "nbt": null, "kind": "item", "unit": "items", "damage": 5, "shard": "3ba7478227a31f51", "recipes": 6}, "label": "purple dye"}, "2": {"count": 1, "damage": 2, "oredict": "", "id": "minecraft:dye", "resolved": {"id": "i:minecraft:dye:2", "name": "cactus green", "mod": "minecraft", "registry": "dye", "icon": 48248, "nbt": null, "kind": "item", "unit": "items", "damage": 2, "shard": "711ed014e02bd903", "recipes": 4}, "label": "cactus green"}}}}

a soul-ution for warp the soul brazier from thaumic exploration will store your permanent warp.

as long as it has ignis centi-vis and mortuus essentia fed from underneath it will stay active, even while you are in other dimensions. turning it off or running out of power will dump all that warp back into your body, so watch out.

containing warp does have a bit of a downside - taint. you'll need to figure out a way to stop that. {"0": {"autoconsume": 0, "consume": 0, "groupdetect": 0, "ignorenbt": 0, "index": 0, "partialmatch": 1, "requireonlyoneitem": 0, "requireditems": {"0": {"count": 1, "damage": 0, "oredict": "", "id": "thaumicexploration:soulbrazier", "resolved": {"id": "i:thaumicexploration:soulbrazier:0", "name": "soul brazier", "mod": "thaumicexploration", "registry": "soulbrazier", "icon": 12714, "nbt": null, "kind": "item", "unit": "items", "damage": 0, "shard": "f97723d302127e65", "recipes": 1}, "label": "soul brazier"}}, "taskid": "bq_standard:retrieval"}} {"0": {"ignoredisabled": 0, "index": 0, "rewardid": "bq_standard:item", "rewards": {"0": {"count": 64, "damage": 1, "oredict": "", "id": "thaumcraft:itemessence", "tag": {"aspects": {"0": {"amount": 8, "key": "mortuus"}}}, "resolved": null, "label": "unknown item (thaumcraft:itemessence, metadata 1)"}}}, "1": {"ignoredisabled": 0, "index": 1, "rewardid": "bq_standard:item", "rewards": {"0": {"count": 1, "damage": 0, "oredict": "", "id": "dreamcraft:coindarkwizardii", "resolved": {"id": "i:dreamcraft:coindarkwizardii:0", "name": "coin &quot;the dark wizard 100&quot;", "mod": "dreamcraft", "registry": "coindarkwizardii", "icon": 20751, "nbt": null, "kind": "item", "unit": "items", "damage": 0, "shard": "3a7190f6cbaa4484", "recipes": 2}, "label": "coin &quot;the dark wizard 100&quot;"}, "1": {"count": 1, "damage": 2, "oredict": "", "id": "thaumcraft:itemlootbag", "resolved": null, "label": "unknown item (thaumcraft:itemlootbag, metadata 2)"}}}}

can you really see out of those? if you take a little dip into the dark side, you can make these goggles. they give the best discount until you can make infinity armor. and who even does that?

you'll need infusion and some warping research first.

if you're a scaredy-cat you can make the electric goggles on the armor tab instead. {"0": {"autoconsume": 0, "consume": 0, "groupdetect": 0, "ignorenbt": 1, "index": 0, "partialmatch": 1, "requireonlyoneitem": 0, "requireditems": {"0": {"count": 1, "damage": 0, "oredict": "", "id": "taintedmagic:itemwarpedgoggles", "resolved": {"id": "i:taintedmagic:itemwarpedgoggles:0", "name": "warped goggles of revealing", "mod": "taintedmagic", "registry": "itemwarpedgoggles", "icon": 12106, "nbt": null, "kind": "item", "unit": "items", "damage": 0, "shard": "f456a4b70728d525", "recipes": 1}, "label": "warped goggles of revealing"}}, "taskid": "bq_standard:retrieval"}, "1": {"autoconsume": 0, "consume": 0, "groupdetect": 0, "ignorenbt": 1, "index": 1, "partialmatch": 1, "requireonlyoneitem": 0, "requireditems": {"0": {"count": 1, "damage": 0, "oredict": "", "id": "taintedmagic:itemvoidmetalgoggles", "resolved": {"id": "i:taintedmagic:itemvoidmetalgoggles:0", "name": "void metal goggles of revealing", "mod": "taintedmagic", "registry": "itemvoidmetalgoggles", "icon": 12096, "nbt": null, "kind": "item", "unit": "items", "damage": 0, "shard": "642e529dd4005241", "recipes": 1}, "label": "void metal goggles of revealing"}}, "taskid": "bq_standard:retrieval"}} {"0": {"ignoredisabled": 0, "index": 0, "rewardid": "bq_standard:item", "rewards": {"0": {"count": 2, "damage": 5, "oredict": "", "id": "thaumcraft:blockcustomplant", "resolved": {"id": "i:thaumcraft:blockcustomplant:5", "name": "vishroom", "mod": "thaumcraft", "registry": "blockcustomplant", "icon": 12548, "nbt": null, "kind": "item", "unit": "items", "damage": 5, "shard": "4b776f974c727dc4", "recipes": 0}, "label": "vishroom"}}}}

gen xxxxxxxxxx... yes! yes! the eyes! you understand now, it is all too clear! the land of riches, it is yours! but what is this? it's empty? why, where have your riches gone? the sole inhabitant tells you that all such things have faded away long ago, with the end of time at hand...but that simply means you're in the right place after all! you're simply in the wrong time. if you simply adjust the portal a little, you can arrive at the right place and time to get your well-deserved riches. you suspect that such an adjustment would require something strong...infinitely strong.

in the meantime you now have a very very big closet to store your things in once the old owner...moves out. upon leaving, you spot a tiny ghast, surely just your imagination? unfortunately the shifting of time causes you to end up in what is likely wilderness when you leave. (exiting through the portal sends you back to the world spawn)

in order to build a machine to take you to both the right place and time, you're going to have to roll up your sleeves and get to the very limits of technological prowess you can imagine. (see the endgame goals tab when you're ready) {"0": {"biome": -1, "dimension": 112, "hideinfo": 0, "index": 0, "invert": 0, "name": "the end of time", "posx": 0, "posy": 0, "posz": 0, "range": -1, "structure": "", "taskid": "bq_standard:location", "taxicabdist": 0, "visible": 0}} {"0": {"ignoredisabled": 0, "index": 0, "rewardid": "bq_standard:item", "rewards": {"0": {"count": 1, "damage": 10, "oredict": "", "id": "enhancedlootbags:lootbag", "resolved": {"id": "i:enhancedlootbags:lootbag:10", "name": "lootbag (magic adept)", "mod": "enhancedlootbags", "registry": "lootbag", "icon": 21196, "nbt": null, "kind": "item", "unit": "items", "damage": 10, "shard": "6ec9c2734b521a68", "recipes": 1}, "label": "lootbag (magic adept)"}}}}

really (really!) dark magic fools. fools i say! they know nothing! this book will guide me, yes. yes it will, my precious. it will lead us to even more power!

available in your local bookstore, and also occasionally found on crimson knights and crimson clerics.

