wireless 2.0 this is the good wireless terminal. it allows you to combine 4 different types of terminals into one ultimate terminal for usage on the go; crafting, patterning, interface, & level.

if you make this combined version, it even allows you to program large processing patterns without needing luv parts to make the processing pattern terminal first.

