a simple cart in order to create or customize your cart you need a hull to attach your desired upgrades to. the wooden one can be used for really simple applications, but to farm wheat or wood, you need at least an iron one.

warning: unprotected carts can be knocked off their rails by lightning. cover the area with glass (or any solid block) to prevent carts from disappearing.

