item overflow chip this chip stores the items in a connected inventory. it designates a storage for items that have no other place to go. it is strongly recommended to have a default storage for items in every pipe system, otherwise bad stuff can happen. best used with a large chest (diamond for example).

it seems to have some bugs though, so don't craft more than one without testing it first.

