no benzene yet this questbook page is supposed to explain the benzene powergen line, but you might have noticed that you haven't made any benzene yet. that's because the recipe path to get it from charcoal has an mv recipe, and you can't just skip straight to mv with the small amount of steam you were using in the bronze age.

there are also other paths for renewable power in this page. they have similar sources, or the same source, but different processing lines, and the entire thing looks like a tree branch, with many different ways in which you can go. the carbon monoxide path is one example of this, and there are many more to come in the future.

regardless of which path you chose to get power from your charcoal, you can now sustain an ebf comfortably and get power more efficiently. it's recommended that you move away from steam in the next tier, because you will need to transport too much of it to produce good amounts of mv power. fortunately, you won't need steam at all! {"0": {"index": 0, "taskid": "bq_standard:checkbox"}} {"0": {"ignoredisabled": 0, "index": 0, "rewardid": "bq_standard:item", "rewards": {"0": {"count": 1, "damage": 32650, "oredict": "", "id": "gregtech:gt.metaitem.01", "resolved": {"id": "i:gregtech:gt.metaitem.01:32650", "name": "robot arm (lv)", "mod": "gregtech", "registry": "gt.metaitem.01", "icon": 41025, "nbt": null, "kind": "item", "unit": "items", "damage": 32650, "shard": "d4c974999f5619a7", "recipes": 3}, "label": "robot arm (lv)"}}}}

normal or magic there are two different super fuels, not just one. the regular solid super fuel (ssf) has a heat value of 100k, whereas the magic solid super fuel (mssf) has it as 150k, or 50% more eu per block. as you can guess, the second one is more valuable, and worth it to make, but it requires even more processing than the first one.

the good part is, you don't really need lots of thaumcraft progression. you barely need any, if at all, because there are many ways to make the magic fuel binder and the block itself, including some that don't use any thaumcraft items. there are so many options that this quest won't ask for a specific one, and it is once again up to you to decide which to choose, if you choose the magic fuel at all. as a tip, alumentum is not mineable like diamonds, but it can be automated by throwing charcoal dust at a cauldron, and it has a higher burn value than the inputs. additionally, for coal coke, only the alumentum option is available.

basically, the ssf has 3 steps: craft the binder, craft the solid block and craft the fluid. the mssf has more steps: craft the binder, upgrade it to magic binder, craft the solid block, craft the fluid and then finish with the extra items. choose your own path. {"0": {"autoconsume": 0, "consume": 0, "groupdetect": 0, "ignorenbt": 1, "index": 0, "partialmatch": 1, "requireonlyoneitem": 0, "requireditems": {"0": {"count": 64, "damage": 32270, "oredict": "", "id": "gregtech:gt.metaitem.02", "resolved": {"id": "i:gregtech:gt.metaitem.02:32270", "name": "super fuel binder", "mod": "gregtech", "registry": "gt.metaitem.02", "icon": 45089, "nbt": null, "kind": "item", "unit": "items", "damage": 32270, "shard": "1c8ed7114ef673ff", "recipes": 16}, "label": "super fuel binder"}}, "taskid": "bq_standard:retrieval"}, "1": {"autoconsume": 0, "consume": 0, "groupdetect": 0, "ignorenbt": 1, "index": 1, "partialmatch": 1, "requireonlyoneitem": 0, "requireditems": {"0": {"count": 64, "damage": 32271, "oredict": "", "id": "gregtech:gt.metaitem.02", "resolved": {"id": "i:gregtech:gt.metaitem.02:32271", "name": "magic super fuel binder", "mod": "gregtech", "registry": "gt.metaitem.02", "icon": 45090, "nbt": null, "kind": "item", "unit": "items", "damage": 32271, "shard": "da85209cee30802c", "recipes": 28}, "label": "magic super fuel binder"}}, "taskid": "bq_standard:optional_retrieval"}} {"0": {"ignoredisabled": 0, "index": 0, "rewardid": "bq_standard:item", "rewards": {"0": {"count": 16, "damage": 32270, "oredict": "", "id": "gregtech:gt.metaitem.02", "resolved": {"id": "i:gregtech:gt.metaitem.02:32270", "name": "super fuel binder", "mod": "gregtech", "registry": "gt.metaitem.02", "icon": 45089, "nbt": null, "kind": "item", "unit": "items", "damage": 32270, "shard": "1c8ed7114ef673ff", "recipes": 16}, "label": "super fuel binder"}, "1": {"count": 1, "damage": 0, "oredict": "", "id": "dreamcraft:cointechnicianiii", "resolved": {"id": "i:dreamcraft:cointechnicianiii:0", "name": "coin &q