80 new colors to play with when you plant a vanilla flower, it is already mature. cut it with shears to get a germling you can replant to make more. break the flower to get a mature flower. turn the flower into pigment using a crafting table.

to get crosses, plant flowers next to empty soil blocks. keep an eye out for weeds. eventually a small germling will start growing.

