base too big? i've got a fix for you! keeping a base spread apart for pollution or explosion prevention can really wear you out, so why not make some concrete to get around faster?

harvest some marble and centrifuge it into calcite, and mix up some concrete in your mixer. next output it into a fluid solidifier with a block mold to make concrete blocks.

