essence altar this little enchanting table like-block doesn't do much on its own, but has two other separate paths that can be taken (the third has no uses currently) to accomplish different tasks.

it is up to you where and how you want your personal essence altar to be upgraded. firstly and more importantly, make the basic essence altar.

