visit the fiery island a fire-oriented biome with huge mountains and a large amount of caves and ores. apart from default ores, this biome also has common igneous rock ore. there are 2 variations of the biome - scorching and mine.

the scorching variation has large blobs of cinder, streams and pools of lava and lilyfires. this is the only place where fire golems and scorching lenses spawn. each island can contain a dungeon puzzle.

