putting the 'semi' back into generators lv you've probably collected a ton of creosote and have little to use it on. to fix that, build a semifluid generator and use it alongside steam as a secondary power source! singleblock generators will only use fuel if there is eu demand, so you might end up with a filled creosote buffer if you aren't consuming enough eu.

to extract the creosote from your coke ovens, you can use a coke oven hatch and some fluid pipes of your choice.

