demonic contract a demonic contract is written on parchment made from the resurrected flesh of the dead. the contract is signed in the blood of the individual to whom it pertains.

a plain demonic contract is used to make a deal with flame imps. the basic contract is crafted with a taglock kit containing the blood of the witch (or warlock).

