a quite different storage regular chests can fill up rather quickly if you happen to collect mob drops like swords and/or armor. by using a cabinet, you can store up to 270 items of the same type. also, it doesn't need a dolly - you can break it normally and it will retain contents.

perfect for storing forestry saplings, bees, or really anything that shares an id but won't stack because of nbt!

