kinetic power hv the kinetic generator will transform mechanical energy into electricity. the eu output depends on the ku input. it is most commonly used together with a kinetic wind generator or kinetic water generator. the kinetic steam generator only has one tier, so you should probably use a steam turbine instead.

when placing a kinetic generator, any time, the "input" side is the side facing you. so you will place the kinetic generator, then the wind/water/steam gen, and then place a rotor inside. power can be drawn from any side of the kinetic generator, up to the rated amount per side.

