liquid cooling tower starting to hit the production limit of the pcb factory? let's install a cooling tower; this will allow any pcb factory within its range to overclock with 2x speed in exchange for 4x eu and 10l/s of distilled water while running.

you can connect this to the pcb factory by first left-clicking the pcb factory controller and then right-clicking the cooling tower controller. one cooling tower can connect to any number of pcb factories within a 16 block radius.

