liquid cooling tower tier 2 with your newfound ability to manipulate spacetime you have found a way to sustain cosmically low temperatures. it is now possible to make an even better cooling unit. a casing able to keep its room temperature very low and nanites which can transfer heat effectively because of their small bodies. you will still need coolant, though water won't cut it any longer given its high freezing point. if only there was some kind of super... coolant...

the tier 2 coolant tower now allows for a 4x speed boost for the same 4x eu cost, making it possible to speed through recipes much quicker. it requires 10 l/s of super coolant to operate while running.

