babies first harvest automaton the crop manager is a single-block machine that will monitor crops in an area around itself and automatically apply fertilizer (fluid or item), weed-ex, and water as needed. the water, fertilizer, and weed-ex can be pumped in directly, or use ic2 universal water cells, normal cells aren't returned when they're used.

just like any other single block machine, crop managers are not rainproof, but you can cover them with a water source block just fine!

