moving your tanks, chests, and barrels want to move your chests and barrels without spilling all the things (buildcraft™)? no problem! make a dolly and you can carry your full chests, barrels or storage drawers anywhere you want. but be warned, you will get a slowness debuff so hopefully you don't have to travel very far. you can also move non-portable buildcraft and iron tanks without losing fluids, and worktables without losing stored recipes.

shift-right-click an empty dolly to collapse it. it won't carry anything until you unfold it, but it will stack and can go in your backpack.

