creosote i guess you already turned some wood into charcoal and wonder what to do with all this creosote? well, you can burn it in a normal furnace to cook your food or anything else, or you can make some torches with it. you can save up on the coal variants, while at the same time keeping the coke oven running for the items you really need.

you can use an iron or clay bucket to pick up the creosote, either through the icon in the machine's interface, or by right-clicking the coke oven with an empty bucket in hand.

