rf batteries basic capacitor banks are rf batteries which can store the rf power you generate. you can put many blocks together to enlarge your total battery capacity - they will merge into one battery.

you can also change the mode of each face using your wire cutters or yeta wrench instead of the gui. one option is a nice display of input and output rf, but it has to be taller than it is wide.

