venting the heat a low-tech method to cool down the hot coolant is to use vent covers. place the cover directly on the side of the chem bath next to a water source block and watch it work its magic. the cover can be used on any gt machine or fluid buffer if you'd prefer another setup.

this will help until you have access to a large heat exchanger to make the process quicker, or a vacuum freezer to skip it altogether.

