speeding with octane one of the components of high-octane gasoline, as the name implies, is octane. it is so important to improve the fuel because of something called "octane rating", which measures how much the fuel resists compression without detonating. the energy that vehicles get to move around comes from this detonation, but being able to apply more compression allows for engine designs that are more efficient, but need the fuel to resist that increased force without detonating. that said, any of these fuels can be run in the engines you use, so the way to represent this efficiency bonus is in the fuel value.

(there is a multi in the next tier that only runs on hog, though. don't forget it.)

how is octane obtained, then? in the last tier, it was explained as coming from light fuel, and this is still how you should, and can obtain it: lightly hydro-cracked light fuel gives some octane, so put a dt for it and leave your diesel needs behind. it's time to move on. {"0": {"autoconsume": 0, "consume": 0, "groupdetect": 0, "ignorenbt": 1, "index": 0, "partialmatch": 1, "requireonlyoneitem": 0, "requireditems": {"0": {"count": 20, "damage": 30995, "oredict": "", "id": "gregtech:gt.metaitem.01", "resolved": {"id": "i:gregtech:gt.metaitem.01:30995", "name": "octane cell", "mod": "gregtech", "registry": "gt.metaitem.01", "icon": 40589, "nbt": null, "kind": "item", "unit": "items", "damage": 30995, "shard": "3ae01dcae79502e6", "recipes": 1}, "label": "octane cell"}}, "taskid": "bq_standard:retrieval"}} {"0": {"ignoredisabled": 0, "index": 0, "rewardid": "bq_standard:item", "rewards": {"0": {"count": 32, "damage": 0, "oredict": "", "id": "ic2:itemcellempty", "resolved": {"id": "i:ic2:itemcellempty:0", "name": "empty cell", "mod": "ic2", "registry": "itemcellempty", "icon": 8488, "nbt": null, "kind": "item", "unit": "items", "damage": 0, "shard": "e92cf87ab6208ac5", "recipes": 1701}, "label": "empty cell"}, "1": {"count": 1, "damage": 7, "oredict": "", "id": "enhancedlootbags:lootbag", "resolved": {"id": "i:enhancedlootbags:lootbag:7", "name": "lootbag (tier 4 ev)", "mod": "enhancedlootbags", "registry": "lootbag", "icon": 21276, "nbt": null, "kind": "item", "unit": "items", "damage": 7, "shard": "128329d33b3c2bec", "recipes": 1}, "label": "lootbag (tier 4 ev)"}, "2": {"count": 5, "damage": 0, "oredict": "", "id": "dreamcraft:coinchemistii", "resolved": {"id": "i:dreamcraft:coinchemistii:0", "name": "coin &quot;the chemist 100&quot;", "mod": "dreamcraft", "registry": "coinchemistii", "icon": 20736, "nbt": null, "kind": "item", "unit": "items", "damage": 0, "shard": "fb08f66bce752e14", "recipes": 2}, "label": "coin &quot;the chemist 100&quot;"}}}}

super distillation your tallest and closest buddy, the distillation tower. you've relied on it so much, haven't you? it's time to take it down.

no, not really, but you can do better now. the catch is that the upgrade to this, the dangote distillus, is special in the sense that its crafting recipe is in the chemical plant, and the one you have to build for this recipe is very expensive. should you decide to accept the costs, though, you can build a dangote in much the same way as the dt.

in summary, this multi runs faster than the dt by doing parallels, a recipe done multiple times at once. a quad dt that you were using to distill oil can be replaced by a dangote, and so on. since distillation is usually a bottleneck in speed for oil processing, this multi should prove useful. {"0": {"autoconsume": 0, "consume": 0, "groupdetect": 0, "ignorenbt": 1, "index": 0, "partialmatch": 1, "requireonlyoneitem": 0, "requireditems": {"0": {"count": 1, "damage": 31021, "oredict": "", "id": "gregtech:gt.blockmachines", "resolved": {"id": "i:gregtech:gt.blockmachines:31021", "name": "dangote distillus", "mod": "gregtech", "registry": "gt.blockmachines", "icon": 24879, "nbt": null, "kind": "item", "unit": "items", "damage": 31021, "shard": "dc5e8e0bb22beccc", "recipes": 1}, "label": "dangote distillus"}}, "taskid": "bq_standard:retrieval"}} {"0": {"ignoredisabled": 0, "index": 0, "rewardid": "bq_standard:item", "rewards": {"0": {"count": 3, "damage": 132, "oredict": "", "id": "gregtech:gt.blockmachines", "resolved": {"id": "i:gregtech:gt.blockmachines:132", "name": "super tank iii", "mod": "gregtech", "registry": "gt.blockmachines", "icon": 23560, "nbt": null, "kind": "item", "unit": "items", "damage": 132, "shard": "a3727ad0d8c3fc5b", "recipes": 3}, "label": "super tank iii"}, "1": {"count": 1, "damage": 8, "oredict": "", "id": "enhancedlootbags:lootbag", "tag": {"ench": {"0": {"id": 35, "lvl": 3}}}, "resolved": null, "label": "unknown item (enhancedlootbags:lootbag, metadata 8)"}, "2": {"count": 1, "damage": 0, "oredict": "", "id": "dreamcraft:cointechnicianiii", "resolved": {"id": "i:dreamcraft:cointechnicianiii:0", "name": "coin &quot;the technician 1000&quot;", "mod": "dreamcraft", "registry": "cointechnicianiii", "icon": 20785, "nbt": null, "kind": "item", "unit": "items", "damage": 0, "shard": "8dafd96c255dc718", "recipes": 2}, "label": "coin &quot;the technician 1000&quot;"}, "3": {"count": 1, "damage": 0, "oredict": "", "id": "dreamcraft:coinchemistiii", "r